From 0887fc397179a53e04061c79a4849d66ade287dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Scott Miller <scott@360machineshop.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 16:30:49 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(post): honor rotary sign conventions in G43.4 output

Apply the resolved table_rh sign in Fanuc and Doosan rotary words.
Judge the same signed pose angle against machine travel.
Pin convention inheritance, overrides, modal output and travel refusals.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #4436
